### 4. `web/src/components/api-service/embed-modal/index.less` (hunk `@@ -19,3 +19,6 @@`)

**Defect 14 — Line 21: `.optionContainer` class defined but no specificity guarantee — may be overridden by global styles**
```less
.optionContainer {
  padding: 10px;
}
```
Single-class selector (specificity 0,0,1,0). If any global style uses `.optionContainer` with higher specificity or `!important`, padding is lost.
**Failure scenario:** Global reset or framework style defines `.optionContainer { padding: 0 !important; }` → options render cramped.

